  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 160 × 8 - 22 × 11 ÷ 180 × 6 - 4 = ?\n\n \n \n\n **Signs**\n **Interchanged signs**\n \n \n\n +\n -\n \n \n\n -\n +\n \n \n\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\n ÷\n ×\n \n \n\n \n\n⇒ __**160 ÷ 8**__ + __**22 ÷ 11**__ × __**180 ÷ 6**__ + 4 = ?\n\n⇒ ? = 20 + __**2 × 30**__ + 4\n\n⇒ ? = __**20 + 60 + 4**__\n\n⇒** ? = 84**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"84\".**",
